      "y": 1209.692116711025,
      "width": 1300,
      "height": 60,
      "text": "Key Features: Multi-tenant SaaS • Self-hosted option • Full-stack TypeScript • Domain-driven design • 28 feature modules • Multi-language support (14 languages) • Integration ready (Stripe, OpenAI, SMS providers)\nExternal Systems: Email providers (SendGrid, Resend, etc.) • SMS/Telegram providers • Payment gateway (Stripe) • AI services (OpenAI) • File storage",
