    {
      "id": "C62e6UlbFv1vk5oWbsSp_",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3883.74615181758,
      "y": 5342.255557736298,
      "width": 1300,
      "height": 60,
      "text": "ARCHITECTURE NOTES: This Archimate overview shows Torqvoice's layered architecture. The system uses Next.js for both frontend and API routes, Prisma ORM for database access, and integrates with multiple external services. Multi-company support is built into the core data model. Custom fields extend service records and quotes. Role-based access control (RBAC) manages permissions across Owner, Admin, and Member roles.",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "ARCHITECTURE NOTES: This Archimate overview shows Torqvoice's layered architecture. The system uses Next.js for both frontend and API routes, Prisma ORM for database access, and integrates with multiple external services. Multi-company support is built into the core data model. Custom fields extend service records and quotes. Role-based access control (RBAC) manages permissions across Owner, Admin, and Member roles.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#666666",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "roundness": null,
      "groupIds": [],
