      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1778145638353,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "| **INTERNAL STAKEHOLDERS** |",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "| **INTERNAL STAKEHOLDERS** |",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "qSgMamNAra_PsSB8-t716",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 830.7311655070143,
      "y": 5553.318954295223,
      "width": 785.6594848632812,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bFE",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 505899201,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 88987457,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1778145638353,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "| 1 | **Workshop Owner / Manager** | Business profitability, revenue growth,\nmulti-location management, accurate financial reporting, operational efficiency |\n**HIGH** | Loss of business oversight; inability to scale; poor financial decision-\nmaking; competitive disadvantage in market; potential business failure |",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "| 1 | **Workshop Owner / Manager** | Business profitability, revenue growth, multi-location management, accurate financial reporting, operational efficiency | **HIGH** | Loss of business oversight; inability to scale; poor financial decision-making; competitive disadvantage in market; potential business failure |",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "vRMgwTccsI_PNSViu5Lg4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 824.7112070109206,
      "y": 5663.318954295223,
      "width": 797.6994018554688,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bFF",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1223770063,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 546240847,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1778145638353,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "| 2 | **Service Technician** | Quick job assignment, clear work order status, labor\ntracking, parts availability, performance metrics visibility | **HIGH** | Inefficient\nworkflow; frustration leading to poor work quality; staff turnover; increased\nerrors and rework; delayed customer service |",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "| 2 | **Service Technician** | Quick job assignment, clear work order status, labor tracking, parts availability, performance metrics visibility | **HIGH** | Inefficient workflow; frustration leading to poor work quality; staff turnover; increased errors and rework; delayed customer service |",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "PIzgIAvsRkCsrUF5OdOxi",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 826.4711862589675,
      "y": 5760.818954295223,
      "width": 794.179443359375,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bFG",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1772005537,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 787695393,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1778145638353,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "| 3 | **Inventory/Parts Manager** | Stock level tracking, low-stock alerts,\nsupplier ordering, parts cost management, historical usage patterns | **MEDIUM-\nHIGH** | Stock-outs causing service delays; excess inventory tying up capital;\nlost sales due to unavailable parts; supplier relationship breakdown; inflated\ncosts |",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "| 3 | **Inventory/Parts Manager** | Stock level tracking, low-stock alerts, supplier ordering, parts cost management, historical usage patterns | **MEDIUM-HIGH** | Stock-outs causing service delays; excess inventory tying up capital; lost sales due to unavailable parts; supplier relationship breakdown; inflated costs |",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "KyhU_VR-WbefmxS5-U-1R",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 827.2711740519362,
      "y": 5908.318954295223,
      "width": 792.5794677734375,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bFH",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 58093039,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1646327663,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1778145638353,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "| 4 | **Administrative / Office Staff** | Customer data management, appointment\nscheduling, quote generation, invoice creation & sending, communication history |\n**HIGH** | Operational chaos; customer service failures; administrative burden;\nmanual errors; missed invoicing; customer complaints; data loss |",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "| 4 | **Administrative / Office Staff** | Customer data management, appointment scheduling, quote generation, invoice creation & sending, communication history | **HIGH** | Operational chaos; customer service failures; administrative burden; manual errors; missed invoicing; customer complaints; data loss |",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ezBSp6x2GfK8xUR-Q3x9y",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 824.591181376155,
      "y": 6018.318954295223,
      "width": 797.939453125,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
