      "versionNonce": 102742785,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1778145638353,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "| 5 | **Bookkeeper / Accountant** | Financial accuracy, payment tracking\n(paid/unpaid/partial), tax-compliant reporting, audit trails, invoice reconciliation |\n**MEDIUM-HIGH** | Accounting errors; compliance violations; tax penalties; audit\nfailures; delayed financial statements; inability to reconcile accounts |",
