      "updated": 1778145681588,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "| Billing / finance user | Track invoices, payment status, partial payments,\nrecurring invoices, taxes, and payment provider reconciliation. | High | Revenue\nleakage, incorrect financial records, customer disputes, and weak cash-flow\ncontrol. |",
