      "text": "| Car owner / workshop customer | Request service, view vehicle history, review\nquotes, approve or reject quote items, view invoices, pay online, and receive\nstatus updates. | Medium | Lower trust, delayed approvals, payment friction, and\nincreased phone/email workload for the workshop. |",
