      "updated": 1778145681588,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "| Fleet customer / business customer | Track multiple vehicles, service history,\ninvoices, and repeat service needs across a fleet. | Medium | Fleet downtime\nincreases and the workshop may lose recurring commercial business. |",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "| Fleet customer / business customer | Track multiple vehicles, service history, invoices, and repeat service needs across a fleet. | Medium | Fleet downtime increases and the workshop may lose recurring commercial business. |",
