      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "| Payment provider | Process checkout, payment confirmation, refunds or status\nverification through integrations such as Stripe, PayPal, or Vipps. | Medium |\nOnline payments fail or cannot be reconciled, increasing manual payment handling. |",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
