      "text": "| Email provider | Deliver quotes, invoices, reports, password flows, and customer\nnotifications through SMTP or providers such as Resend, Postmark, Mailgun,\nSendGrid, or SES. | Medium | Customers miss important documents and account or\nnotification flows become unreliable. |",
