      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "| 1 | **Workshop Owner / Manager** | System ROI, operational efficiency,\nfinancial visibility, compliance with regulations, customer retention | **High** |\nLoss of competitive advantage; inability to scale; poor financial management;\ncustomer churn; regulatory violations |",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "| 1 | **Workshop Owner / Manager** | System ROI, operational efficiency, financial visibility, compliance with regulations, customer retention | **High** | Loss of competitive advantage; inability to scale; poor financial management; customer churn; regulatory violations |",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "MqjUODSIF8iFLUSJIj8P3",
