      "locked": false,
      "text": "| 2 | **Workshop Technician** | Job efficiency, clear work assignments, time\ntracking accuracy, access to vehicle/job history, minimal admin overhead | **High**\n| Reduced productivity; errors in service delivery; frustration leading to turnover;\npoor quality work; customer dissatisfaction |",
      "fontSize": 20,
