      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "| 3 | **Office Manager / Receptionist** | Easy customer management,\nappointment scheduling, communication tools, invoice generation, customer data\naccuracy | **High** | Scheduling conflicts; communication delays; billing errors;\ncustomer confusion; operational bottlenecks |",
      "fontSize": 20,
